<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97556" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγγυμν-άζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>train</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ ταὐτὸ τὴν φάλαγγα καὶ τοὺς
					μισθοφόρους Ἕλληνας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					5.65.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑαυτὸν πρὸς βλασφημίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.L.
					6.90
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς θέσιν τοὺς μαθητάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					5.3
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i>exercise oneself with</i> or <i>together</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				217b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				217c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1172a4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Sto.Herc.</u>
				339.9
			</span></i>, etc.: in aor.
			
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγγυμνάσθητι ἐμπείροις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BGU</u>
					615.25
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span> (but aor.
			
				Med.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεγυμνάσατο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phot.
					<u>Bibl.</u>
					p.173
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i>).—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be organized</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταλήψεις -γεγυμνασμέναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Zeno Stoic.
					1.21
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς ἔργοις συγγεγυμνασμένος</span>
			<i>experienced</i>, dub.l.in <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.217
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγγυμνασθῆναι ποικιλώτερον</span>
			<i>gain</i> more varied <i>experience</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				<u>Vit.Hippocr.</u>
				4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			
			aor.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εγυμνάσθην</span>
			<i>struggle, contend</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τινας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PSI</u>
					1.93.6
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>.</div>
